# Line endings are a repository property, not a tool or platform property.
# Text files are stored and checked out with LF everywhere; tools that write
# CRLF on Windows (perl text-mode layers) are normalized on add. The one
# fixture that exists to exercise CRLF handling keeps its bytes.
* text=auto eol=lf
t/capture/crlf.tex text eol=crlf
t/capture/positions.tex whitespace=-trailing-space
